        },
        "quote": "(a) Applications for examination for a master mobile home craftsman license, a journeyman mobile home craftsman license, or an apprentice mobile home craftsman license shall be made to the Mobile Home Craftsmen Board of Examiners. The Board shall examine the applicant, shall consider such applicant’s experience, training and other qualifications and, upon successful passage of the examination, shall issue the license for which application was made. The minimum qualifications shall be the same as are set out in this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.95.030:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
